Subject: [PATCH 3/6] M2-C2b4 b4-3 arena-clone numerics debug (env-gated,
 default CPU green): add per-node output dump (STREAM_MOE_DUMP_DIR/LAYER +
 temp/cmp_layer_dump.js) for CPU-vs-GPU comparison. Fixed: build cgraph via
 ggml_build_forward_expand (hand-filled nodes[] made vulkan compute no-op -
 whole layer wrote zeros); strided k_chain view inputs (weighted per-expert
 cols, nb=4/90112) now get a GGML_OP_DUP cont copy to a dedicated arena region
 (vulkan elementwise kernels index linearly); external mm cur uses a
 contiguous-nb leaf (src may be reshaped with base stride). REPEAT/GET_ROWS
 now byte-identical, GLU/MUL/mm close (ulp); remaining: gate_up mm NaN from
 element 2348 (per-expert/fused layout) - candidates recorded in WIP (cur 3D
 nb, w3d Q4_K offset, ids leaf) for fresh-session field-by-field diff vs
 exec_mm_vk. RAM IDENTICAL.

